2 CONC f Petronila and Martin has not been located yet, however, they were referenced several times as an ancestral married couple "Martin Nabarro" and "Petronila Montesuma" in a 1703 Diocese of Guadalajara informacion matrimonio documen
2 CONC t for a marriage that took place in Nochistl?ín. The known children of Petronila Sotelo (alias Moctezuma) and of Martin Gabai de Navarro are shown below:
