2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT A daughter of Francisco de Trujillo and dona Lucia de Montoya, named Bernardina de Salas y Trujillo, wife of Andres Hurtado, whose older daughters married several prominent and prolific colonists before and after the Reconquest.  
2 CONC Several male Trujillos mentioned at the time of the Rebellion, and after, must have been his children or grandchildren, there being no other known Trujillo at this period.
