1 OCCU Brief Life History When Isabel Jorge de Vera was born about 1663, in Rio Abajo, Nuevo Mexico (New Spain), her father Antonio Jorge de Vera was 31 and her mother, Gertrudes Baca was 25. She married Juan Antonio Montano de Sotomayor
2 CONC  about 1679 in New Mexico
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ysabel Jorge de Vera
2 CONT * Born: 1663, Santa Fé, Santa Fé, Nuevo Méjico, Nueva España  
2 CONT * Marriage: Juan Antonio Montaño de Sotomayor about 1679 in Santa Fé, Santa Fé, Nuevo Méjico, Nueva España  
2 CONT * Died: 25 Nov 1736, Alburquerque, Bernallilo. Nuevo Méjico, Nueva España at age 73  
2 CONT
2 CONT Another name for Ysabel was de Vera Ysabel Gorge
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT * Joseph, who married Maria de Cuellar 
2 CONT * Juan, who married Juana Gallegos 
2 CONT * Lucas, who married Juana de Anaya Almazan 
2 CONT * Polonia, who married Salvador de Santisteban 
2 CONT * Leonor, who married Luis Duran y Chaves, then Francisco de la Crus 
2 CONT * Magdalena, who married Antonio Duran y Chaves 
2 CONT * Juana, who married Nicolas Duran y Chaves 
2 CONT * Those who must have died very young were Antonio, Manuel, José and María . 
2 CONT
