2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Nicolás de Castañeda who married Antonia de Vargas Machuca who also had Apolonia de Castañeda. This last daughter married Capt. Sebastián Flores de Robles ca. 1693.
2 CONT > It will be interesting to further research the Castañeda and Carrión families, there are many missing links in the genealogy.
2 CONT > I hope this helps somehow.
2 CONT > Daniel Méndez de Torres Camino
