2 CONT
2 CONT On the second day of the month of May in the year one thousand six hundred and sixty-six, I married and did not marry Cristóbal de Medina , a Spaniard, with María de Ávila . Having preceded the proceedings that the Holy Council pr
2 CONC ovides. The high school graduate Mr. Francisco Carrara, the lawyer Juan López and Francisco Sotelo were witnesses. And I signed it.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gerónimo López del Carpio
2 CONT Marriage to Nicolasa Ruiz de Lomas [2]
2 CONT January 22, 1694: I married and veiled, in facie ecclesie , Cristóbal de Medina , a Spaniard, widower of María de Ávila , resident of this said town [Aguascalientes]; with Nicolasa Ruiz de Lomas , [Spanish] neighbor and native of 
2 CONC this said town, legitimate daughter of Antonio Díaz de Lomas and Luisa de Tiscareño, deceased.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT He died before December 19, 1711. [3]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
