2 CONT
2 CONT Agustín de Salazar, married to Felipa de Gamboa, with two sons named Antonio, four and Miguel, two. Likewise, living in this house were his mother-in-law, named Lucía Martín, with one daughter, a young woman named Petrona Domíngue
2 CONC z, sixteen. He states that being given a way to settle that kingdom, he will go with his family
