2 DATE BEF 28 NOV 1731
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} In the villa of Aguascalientes on the twenty-eighth day of March ninety-four, I married in facie ecclesiæ to Juan de Medina Altuna , Spaniard, neighbor of this jurisdiction [Aguascalientes], legitimate son of Crist
2 CONC óbal de Medina Altuna and Maria de Ávila , deceased, with Teresa Diaz de Lomas, Spaniard, neighbor of this villa, legitimate daughter of Antonio Diaz de Lomas and of Luisa de Tiscareño, deceased having preceded the diligences orde
2 CONC red by the Holy Council of Trent, reading three admonitions inter missarum solemniaon holidays, the first being Sunday, the fourteenth of March, the second Friday, the nineteenth day of the Lord Saint Joseph, and the third, the tw
2 CONC enty-first of said month. And when expressing his wishes, Don Joseph de Muñatones, Joseph de Guzmán, and Salvador de Villalobos were witnesses and for the record I signed it.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sebastian Murillo Ordoñez
2 CONT Fuentes
2 CONT ↑ Mexico, Aguascalientes, parish records, 1620-1962, Aguascalientes, Asunción de María, Marriages 1663-1702, image 256 of 325.
2 CONT See also:
2 CONT
2 CONT George Fulton - Aguascalientes Marriage Information
2 CONT Volume 1694: image 173
2 CONT 03 Feb 1694
2 CONT Groom: de Medina, Juan (Spanish; 22)
2 CONT Father: de Medina, Christobal
2 CONT Mother: by Abila, Maria
2 CONT Bride: Dias de Lomas, Teresa (Espanola; 15)
2 CONT Father: Dias de Lomas, Antonio
2 CONT Mother: Tiscareno, Luisa
2 CONT related layoffs
2 CONT Guadalajara Dispensas http://www.guadalajaradispensas.com/
2 CONT Mexico, Jalisco, parish records, 1590-1995, Guadalajara, Diocese of Guadalajara, Marriages 1720-1723, image 23 of 619.
2 CONT Mexico, Jalisco, parish records, 1590-1979, Guadalajara, Diocese of Guadalajara, Marriages 1790, image 1188 of 1352.
2 CONT Maria de la Luz Montejano Hilton, SACRED MITER OF GUADALAJARA FORMER BISHOP OF NEW GALICIA, #1066, page 199.
2 CONT Sacred Miter of Guadalajara. Roll 167991 OAH 2353 pt. 5. Loose Leaf Marriages. 1709-1746. November 28, 1731
