2 CONT
2 CONT Fray Angelico Chavez, Origins of New Mexico Families, Revised Edition 1992, 157. Juan Antonio de Carvajal, son of Alonso de Carvajal and Ana Varela, both natives of New Mexico and deceased, married Josefa Martín, daughter of Luis 
2 CONC Martín and María de la Vega, on June 8, 1701.
