1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Maria de Zamora''' born Maria Martin Serrano, born 1688 at Guadalupe del Paso, New Mexico, New Spain, died at Albuquerque, New Mexico, New Spain
2 CONT
2 CONT Maria was probably the natural daughter of Luis Martin Serrano III as she was born in 1688. When her mother, Maria de la Vega, re-married Juan de Zamora, Maria Martin became his step-daughter and was also known as Maria Zamora.It 
2 CONC seems that here is where the Zamora surname entered into this line.  Maria was a member of Diego de Vargas Reconquest of NM.
