2 CONT
2 CONT 1717, April 9 (no. 16), Santa Cruz. ISIDRO MEDINA (25) of Sta. Fe, son of Capt. Diego de Medina, deceased, and Maria Telles Jiron, and Catarina Martin (18) of Chimayo, d. of Cristobal Martin and Maria Montoya, natives of New Mexic
2 CONC o. --Witnesses: Don Jose Manuel Giltomey, notaryj in Sta. Fe; Felipe de Tamaris (29) and Luis Ortiz (27), soldiers. Miguel de Quintana, notary in Sta. Cruz; Alfonso Fernandez (50), n. of Sombrerete, married, and Juan Antonio Apoda
2 CONC ca (27), n. of New Mexico, married. Pair married, May 3, 1717, with witnesses Marcial Martin and Lugarda Medina. “ https://repository.unm.edu/.../1928/14546/Volume7.pdf...
