2 DATE 1708
2 ADDR
3 CITY Alburquerque
3 STAE Provincia de Nuevo México
3 CTRY Reino de Nueva España
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Francisca Montoya is identified as the daughter of Diego Montoya and Josefa de Ynojos based on the following circumstantial evidence:
2 CONT
2 CONT Francisca Montoya was a known wife of Baltasar Romero. (Roots, Vol.2, p.218) Angelico Chavez states that Diego Montoya and Josefa Hinojos had a daughter, name not known, who was the second wife of Baltasar Romero. (Origins, p.236)
2 CONC  Diego Montoya passed muster in 1680 with his wife and two children - unnamed. (Origins, p.78)
2 CONT
2 CONT Twelve years later, in 1692, Diego and Josefa are listed with six children, none older than eight years. (Population of the El Paso District in 1682, Mid-America Magazine, 1941, p.63) The two children with him in 1680 could have e
2 CONC ither died or married.
2 CONT
2 CONT Baltasar and Francisca apparently were married before 1694. Their daughter Jacinta was born about 1694.
2 CONT
2 CONT Francisca Montoya is associated with Diego Montoya and Josefa Hinojos, and known members of their family in the following appearances:
2 CONT
2 CONT On April 25, 1700 at Bernalillo, Baltasar and Francisca were witnesses in the marriage of Diego's son, Salvador, to Manuela Garcia.
2 CONT
2 CONT On Feb. 27, 1700 at Bernalillo, in the only four baptisms performed that day: in the first one, Baltasar Romero and Francisca Montoya are padrinos; in the second, Diego Montoya and Francisca Montoya are padrinos; in the third, a A
2 CONC sencio Pacheco and Maria de Ynojos (probably Josefa); and, in the fourth, for a daughter of Antonio Gallegos and Rosa Montoya, a known daughter of Diego, Baltasar Romero and Francisca Montoya are padrinos.
2 CONT
2 CONT In all probability, Francisca Montoya was the daughter of Diego Montoya and Josefa Hinojos.
2 CONT
2 CONT Francisca married Baltasar Romero.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.ancestry.com/family-tree/person/tree/110326636/person/120136042659 Ancestry Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Oct 3 2017, 13:10:22 UTC''
