1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Maria de la Rosa Montoya''' born 1684 died 1721, age 37
2 CONT
2 CONT Married:
2 CONT #[http://www.geni.com/people/Antonio-Gallegos/6000000013156860062?through=6000000000401594355 Antonio Gallegos, II]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Maria de la Rosa Montoya and Antonio Gallegos, II:
2 CONT #[http://www.geni.com/people/Margarita-Gallego/6000000003639095519?through=6000000013156860062 Margarita Gallegos]
2 CONT #[http://www.geni.com/people/Maria-Gallegos/6000000013156787715 Maria Gallegos]
2 CONT
2 CONT Maria de la Rosa Montoya is the daughter of [http://www.geni.com/people/Diego-de-Montoya/6000000005599075599?through=6000000000401594355 Diego de Montoya, II] and [http://www.geni.com/people/Maria-Ortiz-de-Vera/6000000005599209693
2 CONC ?through=6000000005599075599 Maria Josefa de Hinojos]
2 CONT
2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT
2 CONT She appeared on the Don Diego de Vargas census 22 Dec 1692 to 2 Jan 1693 in El Paso del Norte, Nuevo Méjico. Nueva España.
2 CONT
2 CONT Fourth household, three sons, three daughters, two servants
2 CONT
2 CONT Diego Montoya, regidor, married to Josefa de Hinojos, with six children: Salvador, three; Juan Estevan, five; Antonio, three; '''Maria de la Rosa''', eight; Luisa, four; Juana, two.  Likewise, this household has two married servan
2 CONC ts named Antonio and his wife, Ana Duran.  He states that, as a loyal vassal of his majesty, he is quite ready to enter to settle with his wife and children when I, the governor and captain general, enter.
2 CONT
2 CONT To The Royal Crown Restored, pg. 39
2 CONT
2 CONT == Notes ==
2 CONT
2 CONT Kessell, John L. and Hendricks, Rick, editors, To The Crown Restored, The Journals of Don Diego de Vargas, New Mexico, 1692-1694, University of New Mexico Press. 1995, ISBN 0-8263-1559-3
