1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Rita de amaya was married to a different Person. She is the mother of Nicolas Leal de amaya per his birth record. She was from Zacatecas and her tree is in ancestry.com. She remarried a man named samora and n her s
2 CONC on Nicolas likely married a samora. Filomena samora was likely from Zacatecas and related to the samora family there
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT He is of no relationship to Jose Antonio Leal de Leon Cavasos. Indeed he is from tamaulipas where his listed son was born. On the tree of Rita de Amaya shows a previous marriage. there is a birth record for her marriage to Jose Le
2 CONC al with son Nicolas Leal Amaya in the birth range to have fathered his children. otoh, Nicolas Leal Cantu is shown married to a different woman and likely way too old to have fathered the children. Furthermore, Rita de Amaya later
2 CONC  moved to zaragoza where she remarried a man named samora, the spelling of which is the same as Nicolas Leal Amaya's wife filomena Samora on their son's birth record. It is likely that Filomena Samora is of the Samora family of Za
2 CONC ragoza. 
