1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 17. JOSE-JUAN-ANTONIO6 CANALES-GONZALEZ (JOSE-SALVADOR5 CANALES-BENAVIDES, BLAS4 CANALES-MONTEMAYOR, JUAN3 CANALES, JOSE2, ANTONIO1) 
2 CONT *was born 1743 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and 
2 CONT *died April 21, 1792 in Mier, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married MARIA-DE-LOS-SANTOS GARCIA-DE-LA-BARRERA September 18, 1771 in Mier, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, 
2 CONT **daughter of JOSE-GASPAR GARCIA and MARIA-GERTRUDIS DE-LA-BARRERA. She was born 1752.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JOSE-JUAN-ANTONIO CANALES-GONZALEZ and MARIA-DE-LOS-SANTOS GARCIA-DE-LA-BARRERA are:
2 CONT *1. 41. i. JOSE-ANTONIO-TIBURCIO7 CANALES-GARCIA, 
2 CONT **b. April 04, 1773, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. February 01, 1839, Monterrery, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *2. 42. ii. JOSE-ESTEBAN CANALES-GARCIA, 
2 CONT **b. December 23, 1774.
2 CONT *3. iii. MARIA-JOSEFA CANALES-GARCIA, 
2 CONT **b. September 04, 1776, Mier, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT *4. 43. iv. MARIA-LEONOR CANALES-GARCIA, 
2 CONT **b. February 28, 1778, Mier, Tamaulipas, Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. March 11, 1850, Mier, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT *5. v. JOSE-MIGUEL-PRICILIANO CANALES-GARCIA, 
2 CONT **b. January 08, 1781, Mier, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT *6. 44. vi. MARIA-DOROTEA CANALES-GARCIA, 
2 CONT **b. February 09, 1782, Mier, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT *7. vii. MARIA-MARTA CANALES-GARCIA, 
2 CONT **b. March 13, 1784, Mier, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT *8. viii. MARIA-DE-LA-ENCARNACION CANALES-GARCIA, 
2 CONT **b. April 07, 1785, Mier, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT *9. 45. ix. JOSE-SANTIAGO CANALES-GARCIA, 
2 CONT **b. August 10, 1787, Mier, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.somosprimos.com/inclan/canales.htm
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Born in Alamo de los Canales, Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon.  Married in Ciudad Mier.  Died in Ciudad Mier.
