1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Jacinta Peláez''' born c. 1704 died January 27, 1766
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacinta married Antonio de Luna, son of Cristóbal Baca and Gregoria de Luna, on 29 May 1718. (Antonio de Luna was buried on 9 Aug 1729 in Alburquerque, Nuevo Méjico, Nueva España.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacinta next married Antonio Montoya, son of Diego de Montoya and María Josefa de Hinojos. (Antonio Montoya was born circa 1690 in Nuevo Méjico, Nueva España 509.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Census: Spanish, 1750, San Clemente, Nuevo Méjico, Nueva España. 270  Doña Jacinta Palaes; son: Domingo de Luna; wife, Josefa Luzero; their children: José. Amtpmop, infant; granddaughter Catharina; orpahans: usabel, Salvador, Math
2 CONC ás
