0 @N6000000005024502118@ NOTE It has been theorized that María Manuela BACA to be the natural daughter of a genizaro indian who called himself "Antonio Grolé (Gurulé)" and Teresa Gallegos. María is supposed to be the first born child of this couple, followed b
1 CONC y the later births of her siblings; however, a pre-nuptial investigation record for the marriage of Pedro Antonio Martinez and Dolores Abeytia clearly outlines the consanguinity connection between Pedro Martinez and Elena Gonzalez
1 CONC . Manuela is recorded as being the daughter of Gregorio Baca. Consanguinity means one person descended, by blood, from another. Therefore, Manuela must be the natural daughter of Gregorio Baca, not Antonio Grole.
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT Gregorio BACA                 first degree          Cristobal BACA
1 CONT
1 CONT Manuela BACA                  second degree       Juana María BACA
1 CONT
1 CONT Elena Gonzalez                  third degree          María Antonia GALLEGO
1 CONT
1 CONT Pedro Antonio Martinez    fourth degree         Dolores ABEYTIA
